              workedExample:`Answering (b) “Explain two effects of hyperinflation (1923) on Germany.”
Effect 1: Savings became worthless. Middle-class families who had saved for years lost everything, e.g. a loaf that cost 250 marks in January 1923 cost billions by November. This made many resent the Weimar Republic.
Effect 2: Political instability. Anger at the government encouraged extremist attempts such as Hitler’s Munich Putsch in November 1923.`,
