                'Profitability: gross profit margin %, mark-up %, profit in relation to revenue %, return on capital employed %.',
                'Liquidity: current ratio (current assets ÷ current liabilities) and liquid capital ratio ((current assets − inventory) ÷ current liabilities).',
                'Efficiency: rate of inventory turnover (cost of sales ÷ average inventory), trade receivable days and trade payable days.',
                'Limitations: historic data, different accounting policies, inflation, and ignoring non-financial factors such as staff morale or reputation.',
