                'Family life: Ephesians 5 on mutual love; honour parents (Fifth Commandment); care for the elderly. Catholics do not permit divorce with remarriage (annulment possible); many Protestant churches allow remarriage after divorce.',
                'Tradition and change: some keep traditional roles (e.g. male-only priesthood in Catholic and Orthodox churches); others support equality — e.g. the Church of England ordained women priests from 1994 and bishops from 2014.',
