                'Born in Makkah c.570 CE; orphaned young; known as al-Amin ("the trustworthy") as a merchant.',
                'First revelation in 610 CE in the cave of Hira on Mount Nur: Jibril commanded "Iqra" (Read/Recite) — the start of the Quran (Surah 96:1–5), on Laylat al-Qadr.',
                'Persecuted in Makkah because his message of one God threatened the idol trade and tribal leaders; the hijrah to Madinah in 622 CE begins the Islamic (Hijri) calendar and the first Muslim community and mosque.',
