                'Turgor pressure pushes the cell membrane against the wall, keeping plants upright; loss of water causes wilting and plasmolysis.',
                'Active transport uses energy from respiration and carrier proteins to move ions/molecules against a concentration gradient.',
                'Rate of diffusion increases with surface area, temperature and concentration gradient, and decreases with distance.',
