                'Measure satisfaction/retention: number of repeat sales and complaints, mystery shoppers, feedback questionnaires, focus groups.',
                'Retain customers through effective customer service, resolving complaints, loyalty rewards and new products.',
                'Communication methods: TV, radio, cinema, newspapers, magazines, posters, leaflets, online/social media, word of mouth, announcements, sponsorship.',
