                'Fartlek: “speed play” varying pace and terrain — mimics game demands; hard to monitor.',
                'Circuit: stations for different components with set work/rest periods — adaptable to many athletes.',
                'Weight training: free weights, kettlebells, machines; intensity from 1RM; needs a spotter/good technique.',
