                'Associative stage: practice, fewer errors, starts using intrinsic feedback.',
                'Autonomous stage: automatic, consistent, can focus on tactics; uses intrinsic feedback/knowledge of performance.',
                'Feedback: intrinsic (feel), extrinsic (coach/video), knowledge of performance (quality of technique), knowledge of results (outcome).',
